# Architecture Rules

## Core Principles

- Prefer clean and maintainable architecture
- Prioritize readability over clever code
- Keep business logic separated from UI and infrastructure
- Avoid tight coupling between modules
- Prefer composition over inheritance
- Build reusable and scalable modules

